<h3 id="middle-footer">Middle Footer</h3>
<p>
	Middle Footer area is place for your additinoal information like social icons, supported credit cards, copyrights or some text. Custom text for left or right of middle footer can be added in live customizer <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd> → <kbd><samp>Customize</samp></kbd> → <kbd><samp>Theme Options</samp></kbd> → <kbd><samp>Footer</samp></kbd></kbd>. In that area you will also find Back to Top button which can be turned off in the same place in customizer.
</p>